{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">野村：中国互联网新传媒月度App追踪-2026年6月</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中国移动互联网大盘在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年6月保持稳定。NOM最新月度App追踪报告显示，当月中国活跃智能手机用户数同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.2%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.8亿</span>，总使用时长同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.6%</span>，较5月的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.1%</span>有所节奏变化。这份覆盖超过50款头部应用的报告，最值得关注的信号并非总量变化，而是流量正在从消费级AI聊天机器人向企业级AI代理平台转移，同时跨境电商在欧美市场面临政策收紧的实质性冲击。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXmdrmKMldhB9W6Oea9ej0Ju7ffCnHriciawnTmibwRg6ryflHrW5rGfsfFjh0MF3w0IY2jPYKyI46e9l1HGsBiayUkUbX66ettuibk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV6w0iat4vVLI4b8GmkGT52oPoiaMQQzvJ8sBxhtN7rtTcamn7iatz5cqYCqyEVIvJTUOLITwv1ZAQodxfNHrEwatTEXYvW0RC6f0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVOicSFD9Dt9rhpGnic6jPSWDV5K7iaskQKC8Uo32GhY9Vl7mMQGgQmcaXrxUO78ZpInAicuvu4V0UB4icQdHkXAlT6icv17SuN72VvA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXAvq7qyJpHRK00ia6pmkEMKppxdbzHq0PIwG6E5ycqwOdsnn0Ieal62joPI6Mo5TOPT0Yaxko96Lic80aWtlh7glVVrqrg5ynFo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 55-NOM-China Internet - New Media-Monthly App Tracker - June 2026-260729</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
